[al:新概念英语（一）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Thank You, Doctor.]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.78]Lesson 63 | 第63课
[00:03.45]Thank you, doctor. | 谢谢你,医生。
[00:06.45]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.69]Who else is in bed today? Why? | 今天还有谁卧床不起?为什么?
[00:19.22]How's Jimmy today? | 吉米今天怎么样?
[00:21.58]Better. | 好多了。
[00:22.70]Thank you, doctor. | 谢谢你,医生。
[00:25.01]Can I see him please, Mrs. Williams? | 威廉斯太太,我能看看他吗?
[00:29.28]Certainly, doctor. | 当然可以,医生。
[00:31.35]Come upstairs. | 请上楼。
[00:34.17]You look very well, Jimmy. | 吉米,你看起来很好。
[00:37.09]You are better now, but you mustn't get up yet. | 你好多了,但你还不能起床。
[00:42.60]You must stay in bed for another two days. | 你必须再卧床两天。
[00:48.32]The boy mustn't go to school yet, Mrs. Williams. | 威廉斯太太,这孩子还不能去上学。
[00:53.21]And he mustn't eat rich food. | 而且他不能吃油腻的食物。
[00:58.11]Does he have a temperature, doctor? | 医生,他发烧吗?
[01:02.09]No, he doesn't. | 不,他没有发烧。
[01:04.06]Must he stay in bed? | 他必须卧床吗?
[01:07.06]Yes. He must remain in bed for another two days. | 是的。他必须再卧床两天。
[01:12.84]He can get up for about two hours each day, but you must keep the room warm. | 他每天可以起来大约两个小时,但你必须保持房间温暖。
[01:23.49]Where's Mr. Williams this evening? | 威廉斯先生今晚在哪里?
[01:27.35]He's in bed, doctor. | 医生,他躺在床上。
[01:30.48]Can you see him please? | 你能去看看他吗?
[01:33.24]He has a bad cold, too! | 他也得了重感冒!